WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:04.952
Open the menu bar icon, then the gear, for
Settings.

2
00:00:05.522 --> 00:00:10.570
Sharing anonymous usage data and error
reports is on by default,

3
00:00:10.570 --> 00:00:12.779
with no file names or paths.

4
00:00:13.349 --> 00:00:16.836
Switch it off any time, and on again.

5
00:00:17.406 --> 00:00:21.809
Send feedback opens the feedback form in
your browser.

6
00:00:22.379 --> 00:00:27.506
Copy details puts your version and a
reference code on the clipboard,

7
00:00:27.506 --> 00:00:28.844
and sends nothing.
